    <h3>Solution by Etar</h3>

    <pre class="code-block"><button class="copy" title="Copy" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"><i class="far fa-copy"></i></button><code>03a61fc84b6429f07fc0edf25265ef7a0ced3cd9a0edea85e9f58b50b5d73f66e7 - minrange = 03634641685eca3f8284bcd4ddf233dac92a551bb5ff74a0b3fd587d4da7c13eea
03634641685eca3f8284bcd4ddf233dac92a551bb5ff74a0b3fd587d4da7c13eea / (2^361) = 0334a20e64c9a70138783b125ad81196c76585403905dda56a644ac83ac9620045
